<div id="A3.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A3.T10" title="Table 10 ‣ C.1 Hyperparameter settings ‣ Appendix C Experimental Details of Baseline Methods ‣ ReTabAD: A Benchmark for Restoring Semantic Context in Tabular Anomaly Detection" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a> summarizes the hyperparameter search ranges for each model. By default, each configuration searches over <span id="A3.SS1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">scaling_type</span> <math id="A3.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\in\{std,minmax\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\in\{std,minmax\}</annotation></semantics></math> and <span id="A3.SS1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">cat_encoding</span> <math id="A3.SS1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\in\{int,onehot\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>h</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\in\{int,onehot\}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
